Z||000001||Greg Piet||01-24-2001||01:15 PM||||This looks like exactly what i need for my rebuild, except if your motor has been bored out at all...<BR>I guess Ill have to tear apart my spare and see if it was bored over at all.<BR>If I am not mistaken if it was bored 20 over then there is a 20 stamped on top of the piston.<P><P>------------------<BR>SCCA Region 72<BR>#47 CSP<BR>Bring it to the track.<BR>Lets see if all those mods really helped!||||reg||1
